---
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |  Sort: profit.nation ASC NULLS LAST, profit.o_year DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |   Projection: profit.nation, profit.o_year, sum(profit.amount) AS sum_profit                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[profit.nation, profit.o_year]], aggr=[[sum(profit.amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: profit                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |         Projection: mysql.tpch_sf1.nation.n_name AS nation, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_orderdate) AS o_year, mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_discount) - mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp.ps_supplycost * mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_quantity AS amount                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_nationkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_orderkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp.ps_suppkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_suppkey AND mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp.ps_partkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_suppkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_suppkey AND mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_partkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                   Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                     TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.part projection=[p_partkey], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_name LIKE Utf8("%green%")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                     TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                   TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_partkey, l_suppkey, l_quantity, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                 TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.partsupp projection=[ps_partkey, ps_suppkey, ps_supplycost]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |               TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_orderdate]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=mysql compute_context=host=benchmark-mysql.dataplatform.svc.cluster.local,port=3306,db=tpch_sf1,user=root base_sql=SELECT `profit`.`nation`, `profit`.`o_year`, sum(`profit`.`amount`) AS `sum_profit` FROM (SELECT `nation`.`n_name` AS `nation`, EXTRACT(YEAR FROM `orders`.`o_orderdate`) AS `o_year`, ((`lineitem`.`l_extendedprice` * (1 - `lineitem`.`l_discount`)) - (`partsupp`.`ps_supplycost` * `lineitem`.`l_quantity`)) AS `amount` FROM `tpch_sf1`.`part` INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`supplier` ON `part`.`p_name` LIKE '%green%' INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`lineitem` ON ((`supplier`.`s_suppkey` = `lineitem`.`l_suppkey`) AND (`part`.`p_partkey` = `lineitem`.`l_partkey`)) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`partsupp` ON ((`partsupp`.`ps_suppkey` = `lineitem`.`l_suppkey`) AND (`partsupp`.`ps_partkey` = `lineitem`.`l_partkey`)) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`orders` ON (`orders`.`o_orderkey` = `lineitem`.`l_orderkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`nation` ON (`supplier`.`s_nationkey` = `nation`.`n_nationkey`)) AS `profit` GROUP BY `profit`.`nation`, `profit`.`o_year` ORDER BY `profit`.`nation` ASC, `profit`.`o_year` DESC |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
